<#f0f000>:Prince Van Specific Mechanics:
<#00a2e8>Prince's Defense Penetration</>
His Super voice and Shield brakes chip damage are high, 
but they cannot be defeated with those chip kills.

<#00a2e8>Self-damage</>
His Super voice and Shield brakes chip damage are high, 
but they cannot be defeated with those chip kills.

<#00a2e8>Counterattack power-ups</>
His Counter Stance increases in power 
when HP falls below 35%.